# Exact versions of the real CLIs the real-tool tests drive. The one place to
# bump them: install-mock-tools.{sh,ps1}, tests/support/pins.rs and the CI
# cache key all read this file.
#
# After a bump: just ci mock-tools real_tool_codex real_tool_claude test_relay_roundtrip claude_stdio
@openai/codex@0.162.1
# Claude must stay >= 2.1.198: the first release with both `prompt_id` and
# backgrounded Agent/Task calls (tool_response.status="async_launched"), which
# hcom's hook routing has to handle. Below that, CI never exercises either.
# And >= 2.1.286 for native delivery: earlier builds gate mods on a remote flag
# the mock env (DISABLE_GROWTHBOOK etc.) never fetches, so the mod never loads.
